			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with CHANGELOG prose format update\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 119c3aca, bringing in Mountain's documentation update that restructures the CHANGELOG from bullet points to narrative prose paragraphs and adds a new v2.2 section documenting the bundled-electron correctness pass.\n\nThis follows the v2.2 release changelog sync pattern, ensuring the monorepo reflects the latest Mountain documentation improvements.",
